    "rawResponseText": "When owners want a **collection** or **soft-brand** option for a hotel conversion, the brands most commonly considered globally include **Curio Collection by Hilton**, **Vignette Collection by IHG**, and **Marriott’s Autograph Collection** and **Tribute Portfolio**.[2][5]\n\nOther conversion-friendly brands often considered alongside those soft brands are **Spark by Hilton**, **Garner by IHG**, **City Express by Marriott**, **Four Points Flex by Sheraton**, and Accor’s **Mercure**.[1][2][3][4][8]\n\nA practical global shortlist by company is:\n\n- **Hilton:** Curio Collection by Hilton, Tapestry Collection by Hilton, Spark by Hilton[1][2]\n- **IHG:** Vignette Collection, voco hotels, Garner hotels, Ruby[5][7]\n- **Marriott:** Autograph Collection, Tribute Portfolio, City Express by Marriott, Four Points Flex by Sheraton[2][3][8]\n- **Choice:** conversion-focused brands in its development portfolio, especially for owners seeking a flexible franchise model[4]\n\nIf you want, I can also turn this into a **“best soft brands by region”** list or a **comparison table by segment**.",
